 is given a Soul Ring that can be used to increase the player's stats before they even go into the dungeon!<br><br>Journey through different worlds and see what each world's dungeon has to offer! Event dungeons also offer special rewards that cannot be acquired normally in the game!<br><br><strong>Future Content</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Wardrobe Function to change Hero's appearances<br></li><li> More worlds<br></li><li> Seasonal and themed dungeons with exclusive rewards<br></li><li> Hero ascension<br></li><li> Story/lore<br></li><li> and more!</li></ul>",
